### Create a user
POST http://localhost:3001/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "auth0Id": "auth0|test-123",
  "email": "joao@example.com",
  "name": "João"
}

### List users
GET http://localhost:3001/users

### Get one user (paste an id from the list)
GET http://localhost:3001/users/PASTE-ID-HERE

### Invalid id → 400
GET http://localhost:3001/users/abc